                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <h3>🧘 Yoga Mat</h3>
                        <p>A mat for stretching and exercise activities.</p>
                        <p>Price: <strong>₱450.00</strong></p>
                        <button type="button">Add to Cart</button>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <h3>🥗 Lunch Container</h3>
                        <p>A reusable container for packed meals.</p>
                        <p>Price: <strong>₱220.00</strong></p>
                        <button type="button">Add to Cart</button>
                    </td>
